  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added CommandCli namespace with ExtendedCommandSettings, IDeserializer, JsonDeserializer, and FlexibleFilePath for cross-platform path resolution\n- Added FindInFiles extension methods for stream-predicate and regex-based file content search\n- Added Replace extension method for in-place file text transformation\n- Added SafeDeleteDirectory extension method for safely deleting directories\n- Added SimpleExecRunner.Init static factory method\n- Made StringExtensions public and added StringJoin, IsNullOrWhitespace, and IsNullOrEmpty convenience methods",
